  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Tucked-Away at Inlet Beach by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Escape to the quiet end! This adorable townhome sits next to the untouched beauty of Camp Helen State Park at the end of Walton Magnolia Lane. Welcome to the peaceful sands of Inlet Beach. No crowds, no rows of umbrellas—just nature at its best!<br> <br>Highlights:<br>📍 Inlet Beach<br>👣 Just steps to Lupine Beach Access<br>🌿 Camp Helen State Park is your next-door neighbor<br>🛏️ 2 bedrooms, 2 baths<br>🐶 Dog-friendly<br>🍤 Charcoal grill<br>🚲 2 bikes!<br>🚿 Outdoor shower<br>🦞 Explore Rosemary Beach, 30Avenue, Alys Beach<br>🛍️ Eateries and boutiques!<br> <br>How close are you to the beach? Look at the pics! Within seconds, your Inlet Beach adventure begins with a stroll along the pristine beach to the state park, where you can collect shells, wander trails, and spot sea turtle nests and local birds in the nearby sanctuary.<br> <br>You'll even pass a scenic dune lake along the way. Next time, why not bring a paddleboard? Or, simply rent a kayak from the park! It’s all about laid-back vibes and fewer people.<br> <br>Inside, the recently updated home feels bright and welcoming. Both queen bedrooms come with their own deck or balcony—perfect for unwinding. The two full baths have been remodeled, and the living room has a comfy sofa bed, offering plenty of space for you and your group.<br> <br>The kitchen is fully equipped for all your cooking needs, and both the kitchen and living room lead out to private decks where you can soak up the views.<br> <br>Ready for a nature-inspired getaway? Tucked-Away at Inlet Beach is the perfect spot.<br> <br>Overview:<br>- Steps to Lupine Beach Access<br>- 2 bedrooms, 2 baths<br>- 1,100 sq ft<br>- Charcoal grill<br>- Outdoor shower<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- 2 bikes included<br>- Dogs considered, an additional $210 nonrefundable fee for each dog<br><br>Overnight:<br>- Queen in 2nd floor primary bedroom; bath<br>- Queen in 2nd floor guest room; bath<br>- Sleeper sofa in living room<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Tucked-Away at Inlet Beach - Gulf Views, Newly Renovated Townhome!"
        }
      ],
